{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787030377596772001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"brinish-unlit-bagworm","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ab381d5bd86702815b35b31a7f74efdf11abc429f032efe4686b113806c8bf99","event_uuid":"de54bce3-6c64-4979-ae89-d6ad3f8a1b19","position":{"commit_sha":"0d9a510a393f5fc2543293e2fa00cdbcb54392ba","position":"1787028432114144001-de54bce3-6c64-4979-ae89-d6ad3f8a1b19"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"2fb7fb5371525873f45a135309616e7279f4dfe85cb7831a729e3bc4aa55a7ec","event_uuid":"d28a60bf-210e-4680-b266-b935d2d83f83","position":{"commit_sha":"ebcceeb940f73636b97567cf13bc91cb600da545","position":"1787028444267955001-d28a60bf-210e-4680-b266-b935d2d83f83"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0c2cdae5012d0dad520fae8726ab7acc2cfffc8a69c18ed38de215182956595f","event_uuid":"39547d60-c9fe-45ae-a024-65a8fba95c3f","position":{"commit_sha":"97c8f00edcbaf1237daee1c62ea2d63c8f31ca70","position":"1787028449894366001-39547d60-c9fe-45ae-a024-65a8fba95c3f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028432114144001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context\nAfter family cutovers, reachable generic retry, `_best_effort` swallowing, duck-typed dispatch, or duplicate SDK/adapter retry would preserve the original failure class and invite future bypass.\n\n## Outcome\nProve every supported Cloud/DC mutation has exactly one typed coordinator/adapter owner, remove obsolete production fallbacks, and fail unsupported live actions before any effect.\n\n## Plan\n1. Build a dispatch census over every `MutationDirection`/`MutationAction` and Cloud/DC provider route. Require one typed owner or an intentional provider-neutral pre-effect unsupported result.\n2. Remove generic whole-operation retry, `_best_effort` write swallowing, production class-name/duck fallbacks, and duplicate SDK/adapter retry owners after their route is covered.\n3. Keep compatibility only at serialized/public read boundaries; tests use explicit protocol fakes.\n4. Add static/string and runtime poison tests that fail when removed helpers remain reachable from production.\n5. Preserve rollback as code/routing reversion plus remote re-observation; never compensate by deleting successful Jira work.\n\n## Testing\nThe census must fail on missing, duplicate, or fallback owners. Effect spies prove unsupported actions fail before local/remote writes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every supported Cloud/DC mutation route has exactly one typed coordinator/adapter owner.\n- [ ] Unsupported production actions return a typed provider-neutral error before any effect.\n- [ ] Generic whole-operation retry and `_best_effort` write swallowing are unreachable from production.\n- [ ] Production class-name/duck dispatch and duplicate SDK/adapter retry owners are unreachable.\n- [ ] Tests use explicit declared protocols rather than production fallback paths.\n- [ ] Rollback guidance requires re-observation and never remote deletion.\n\n## Out of scope\nFinal output contracts, state advancement, end-to-end validation, and docs.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/applier.py","reason":"Remove legacy generic retry and production dispatch fallbacks."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/batch_dispatch.py","reason":"Remove obsolete whole-operation retry routes."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_coordinator_route_census.py","reason":"Complete route ownership census and runtime poison tests."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3350-90b1-2651-4c50"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3350-90b1-2651-4c50","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","coordinator","cleanup","tdd"],"ticket_id":"b81b-8671-3c61-488f","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S5 T1 — Census typed routes and remove legacy write fallbacks","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_coordinator_route_census.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC6","dd_text":"Complete route census, pre-effect unsupported behavior, fallback removal, protocol fakes, and rollback"}]},"source_event_uuids":["de54bce3-6c64-4979-ae89-d6ad3f8a1b19","d28a60bf-210e-4680-b266-b935d2d83f83","39547d60-c9fe-45ae-a024-65a8fba95c3f"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030377596772001,"uuid":"c5772d9a-5edd-4fc7-93c3-c2f8e4b25cbd"}